box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);\"><h2 style=\"font-size:20px;margin:0 0 8px;\">Cancel appointment with Rich?</h2><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin:0 0 16px;\">Oct 23, 10:00 AM with Sarah Chen</p><span style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;\">Optional message to Rich</span><div style=\"background:#171717;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);min-height:64px;margin-top:6px;\">Add a short note (optional)</div><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);margin:14px 0 0;\">Rich gets the standard email and SMS and must rebook in the app.</p><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:10px;margin-top:22px;\"><span style=\"background:#2a2a2a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;\">Keep appointment</span><span style=\"background:#3a3a3a;color:white;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;\">Cancel appointment</span></div></div></div></div>"
